{"3428870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Disconnect 2", "steam_appid": 3428870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Every jump matters. Master the movement. Find your way forward.</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash through a strange black-and-white world in a fast-paced focused 3D puzzle platforming adventure where the ground disappears beneath you. Move quickly, plan your route, and push your skills to the limit as you search for coins, power-ups, hidden secrets—and clues to a mysterious story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428870/extras/a1234da9006c6db588c96ffafdadf3b9.avif?t=1788087718\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428870/extras_big/a1234da9006c6db588c96ffafdadf3b9.webp?t=1788087718 width=1560 height=1560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PRECISION PLATFORMING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move fast. Think ahead. Commit to every jump.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash from platform to platform as they shrink and disappear beneath you. There’s no room for hesitation. Choose your route, react quickly, and make every movement count—or start again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428870/extras/960c3649f96d20ee8f0e62428257a0e3.avif?t=1788087718\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428870/extras_big/960c3649f96d20ee8f0e62428257a0e3.avif?t=1788087718 width=1560 height=824 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE. COLLECT. DISCOVER.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reaching the end is only part of the challenge.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level hides something. Hunt for coins, discover power-ups and upgrades, search for secrets, and explore every corner to uncover what you missed. How much can you find?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428870/extras/c7c3ca3f30438878578b03dd160c1b1b.avif?t=1788087718\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428870/extras_big/c7c3ca3f30438878578b03dd160c1b1b.webp?t=1788087718 width=1560 height=1560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A MYSTERIOUS STORY THROUGH A DOG’S EYES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Something happened. But what?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete stages to slowly uncover fragments of a mysterious story. Discover more about a dog’s life, the people connected to it, and the strange journey unfolding behind your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428870/extras/fba42e08d984426cb77691809c6bde40.avif?t=1788087718\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428870/extras_big/fba42e08d984426cb77691809c6bde40.webp?t=1788087718 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A WORLD IN BLACK AND WHITE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A striking monochrome world inspired by the raw energy of 1980s and 1990s punk posters.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharp silhouettes, stark contrasts, and a distinctive visual style bring this strange world to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428870/extras/8970f1941a2abe2a5190412f480c33ca.avif?t=1788087718\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AND YES… THERE ARE KANGAROOS!!!!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Every jump matters. Master the movement. Find your way forward.</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash through a strange black-and-white world in a fast-paced focused 3D puzzle platforming adventure where the ground disappears beneath you. Move quickly, plan your route, and push your skills to the limit as you search for coins, power-ups, hidden secrets—and clues to a mysterious story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428870/extras/a1234da9006c6db588c96ffafdadf3b9.avif?t=1788087718\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428870/extras_big/a1234da9006c6db588c96ffafdadf3b9.webp?t=1788087718 width=1560 height=1560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PRECISION PLATFORMING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move fast. Think ahead. Commit to every jump.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash from platform to platform as they shrink and disappear beneath you. There’s no room for hesitation. Choose your route, react quickly, and make every movement count—or start again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428870/extras/960c3649f96d20ee8f0e62428257a0e3.avif?t=1788087718\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428870/extras_big/960c3649f96d20ee8f0e62428257a0e3.avif?t=1788087718 width=1560 height=824 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE. COLLECT. DISCOVER.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reaching the end is only part of the challenge.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level hides something. Hunt for coins, discover power-ups and upgrades, search for secrets, and explore every corner to uncover what you missed. How much can you find?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428870/extras/c7c3ca3f30438878578b03dd160c1b1b.avif?t=1788087718\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428870/extras_big/c7c3ca3f30438878578b03dd160c1b1b.webp?t=1788087718 width=1560 height=1560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A MYSTERIOUS STORY THROUGH A DOG’S EYES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Something happened. But what?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete stages to slowly uncover fragments of a mysterious story. Discover more about a dog’s life, the people connected to it, and the strange journey unfolding behind your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428870/extras/fba42e08d984426cb77691809c6bde40.avif?t=1788087718\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428870/extras_big/fba42e08d984426cb77691809c6bde40.webp?t=1788087718 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A WORLD IN BLACK AND WHITE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A striking monochrome world inspired by the raw energy of 1980s and 1990s punk posters.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharp silhouettes, stark contrasts, and a distinctive visual style bring this strange world to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428870/extras/8970f1941a2abe2a5190412f480c33ca.avif?t=1788087718\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p><p class